可いただけるのなら承認の方よろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Azusa1019/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1aa69862/uploads/origins/91138d24-0344-4d98-87e3-5dca1a55e1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ce8556cde398a4cb0bf70c34090e6b6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1aa69862/uploads/origins/91138d24-0344-4d98-87e3-5dca1a55e1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ce8556cde398a4cb0bf70c34090e6b6, https://si.imgix.net/1aa69862/uploads/origins/91138d24-0344-4d98-87e3-5dca1a55e1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f17c44d5381c4fd9b04ef41670348fb2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1aa69862/uploads/origins/91138d24-0344-4d98-87e3-5dca1a55e1f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01339f97f1b4bdc7e34ffd5a02327095 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先生の褐色で勝気なアンナミラーズの制服姿のお姉様をリクエストさせていただきたいと思います。\nすごくカッコいいキャラ描かれていてこの機会に描いていただきたいと思い切りました。\nご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Azusa1019/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c6142c45/uploads/origins/b32ebc0e-1d23-44c5-a69a-c6b840c2af07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d6779928e645e8f10c4831ec2ffd9e4c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c6142c45/uploads/origins/b32ebc0e-1d23-44c5-a69a-c6b840c2af07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d6779928e645e8f10c4831ec2ffd9e4c, https://si.imgix.net/c6142c45/uploads/origins/b32ebc0e-1d23-44c5-a69a-c6b840c2af07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a153f